  "prefLabel": "Rev 2411.10 Forms Applying Credits for Business Enterprise Tax",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2411.10 Forms Applying Credits for Business Enterprise Tax. A business enterprise reporting a business profits tax credit for research and development, or an economic revitalization zone tax credit, shall complete and file the following applicable form with their business enterprise tax return Form DP-160 “Schedule of Credits”.\n\nSource. #9065, eff 1-10-08; ss by #11032, eff 1-29-16 (formerly Rev 2411.12); ss by #14573, eff 5-2-26, EXPIRES: 5-2-36",
